\f4\b\fs25\fsmilli12667 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf7 \strokec7 THE FRIENDS OF TUNBRIDGE WELLS & RUSTHALL COMMONS \'95 CHARITY NO. 1013975\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\fs53\fsmilli26667 \AppleTypeServices \cf3 \strokec3 Modernising the Friends of the Commons Digital Presence\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf8 \strokec8 A Strategic 3-Pillar Proposal for the Board of Trustees\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f5\i\b0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf9 \strokec9 Prepared for Trustee Board Discussion \'95 Meeting: Monday Afternoon\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f4\i0\b\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf10 \cb11 \strokec10 Executive Summary:
\f6\b0  The Commons represent 256 acres of irreplaceable natural assets, ancient sandstone crags, and living heritage across Royal Tunbridge Wells and Rusthall. As the charity pursues freehold community ownership, our website must serve as our most trusted, resilient, and persuasive civic asset.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf10 \cb11 At present, administrative fragility (demonstrated by recent styling breakdowns) and mobile friction limit our reach and strain volunteer time. This proposal outlines a focused modernisation for a fixed one-off investment of 
\f4\b \'a31,000
\f6\b0  with 
\f4\b \'a30 ongoing software fees
\f6\b0 , built around three core pillars.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f4\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \strokec3 PILLAR 1: ELIMINATING ADMINISTRATIVE FRICTION & VOLUNTEER ANXIETY\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f5\i\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \AppleTypeServices \cf10 \strokec10 From fragile visual page builders to stress-free, form-based publishing.
\f6\i0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4\b \cf10 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 The Operational Vulnerability:
\f6\b0  The current site relies on a brittle WordPress and Elementor setup where design structure and content are interlinked. Routine edits to news posts or events risk corrupting layouts, distorting mobile styling, or breaking global CSS stylesheets (as recently occurred with missing files that disabled public styling). This causes acute stress for administrative volunteers, creates delays in publishing notices, and requires outside technical intervention.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 The Modern Solution (Dedicated Charity Editorial Portal):
\f6\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl1
\f4\b \cf10 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 Simple Form-Field Entry:
\f6\b0  Trustees and volunteers update News, Notices, and Events by simply typing into clear boxes (Title, Date, Description, Photo) and clicking "Publish".\
\ls1\ilvl1
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 Guaranteed Unbreakable Formatting:
\f6\b0  Visual styling, fonts, and mobile responsiveness are hardcoded. It is physically impossible for an editor to break page layout, misalign text, or delete styling.\
\ls1\ilvl1
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 Zero Maintenance Overhead:
\f6\b0  Eliminates plugin update conflicts, security vulnerabilities, and recurring monthly maintenance agency retainers.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f4\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \strokec3 PILLAR 2: DRIVING COMMUNITY DISCOVERABILITY, TRAFFIC & TOWN INTEGRATION\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f5\i\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \AppleTypeServices \cf10 \strokec10 Transforming a static brochure into the go-to digital pocket guide for the Commons.
\f6\i0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f4\b \cf10 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 The Audience Challenge:
\f6\b0  Over 70% of visits occur on mobile devices. When families, walkers, and dog owners visit the Commons, the current website makes it difficult to quickly find parking near Wellington Rocks or Toad Rock, accessible trail routes, or seasonal notices.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 The Modern Solution:
\f6\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f4\b \cf10 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 Mobile-First Visitor Guide:
\f6\b0  Fast-loading interactive trail guides, walking routes, and parking directions tailored for smartphone users out on the Common.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 Local Economy & Tourism Synergy:
\f6\b0  Curated routes connecting the Commons directly to The Pantiles, Spa Valley Railway, High Rocks, and heritage local pubs\'97fostering local business backing and community pride.\
\ls2\ilvl1
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 Search Engine Dominance (SEO):
\f6\b0  Clean, high-performance architecture ensures top Google ranking for high-volume searches such as 
\f5\i "Tunbridge Wells circular walks"
\f6\i0 , 
\f5\i "Toad Rock parking"
\f6\i0 , and 
\f5\i "things to do in Tunbridge Wells"
\f6\i0 , funneling hundreds of prospective supporters to the charity every month.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f4\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \strokec3 PILLAR 3: ACCELERATING MEMBERSHIPS, DONATIONS & STRATEGIC PLEDGES WITH COMMERCIAL SAFEGUARDS\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f5\i\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \AppleTypeServices \cf10 \strokec10 Maximising civic participation while strictly protecting acquisition negotiating leverage.
\f6\i0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f4\b \cf10 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 The Fundraising Challenge:
\f6\b0  Clunky donation forms result in high mobile abandonment. Furthermore, public campaign fundraising must rally the community without jeopardising commercial property negotiations.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 The Modern Solution:
\f6\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl1
\f4\b \cf10 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 One-Touch Mobile Membership & Gift Aid:
\f6\b0  Frictionless sign-up flow supporting Apple Pay, Google Pay, and card payments, allowing residents to join for \'a315/year in under 30 seconds with automated Gift Aid collection.\
\ls3\ilvl1
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 Accessible Community Pledging:
\f6\b0  An inviting pledge gateway starting from an accessible \'a320 tier that collects pledges of support without taking immediate payment.\
\ls3\ilvl1
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec10 Strategic Commercial Safeguard:
\f6\b0  The public-facing campaign showcases widespread town endorsements and community solidarity 
\f4\b without publishing running totals, average pledge values, or financial targets
\f6\b0 . This directly protects the Trustees' negotiating leverage with Targetfollow, preventing counterparties from reverse-engineering the charity's reserves or ceiling budget.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

